  "description": "Welcome to 4 Benson Loop, Alkimos located in the highly desirable Trinity Estate. Situated on an elevated block, this stylish and inviting 3 x 2 home offers the perfect blend of modern comfort and low-maintenance living, making it an ideal choice for your next home.<br/><br/>From the moment you arrive, you will be captured by the homes privacy and security. An elevated cottage style home with a gorgeous modern twist.<br/><br/>Interior Features:<br/><br/>• Step inside to a sleek, contemporary living and dining area designed for relaxed, everyday living.<br/>• At the heart of the home is a stylish kitchen equipped with stainless steel appliances, including a 900mm gas cooktop and oven, a rangehood, a dishwasher, a built-in pantry, and a generous fridge recess.<br/>• The primary bedroom sits at the front of the home, offering a peaceful sanctuary with large windows, robe and a modern ensuite.<br/>• Secondary Bedrooms: Bedrooms two and three are well-proportioned and cozy, featuring soft carpeting, skylights for lovely natural light, and wardrobe recesses.<br/>• A crisp, contemporary main bathroom services the home with a spacious shower, vanity, and toilet.<br/>• Cleverly concealed behind triple sliding doors, the laundry space includes extra linen storage for ultimate practicality.<br/>• Enjoy year-round comfort with reverse-cycle, zoned ducted air conditioning throughout.<br/><br/>Outdoor & Additional Features:<br/><br/>Seamless indoor-outdoor flow takes you through sliding glass doors to a private rear courtyard. Complete with a protective shade sail and easy-care artificial lawn, it is a fantastic, low-maintenance space to unwind.<br/>• Double remote garage accessed from the rear of the property.<br/>• Private Entry: Fully enclosed, secure front courtyard garden.<br/>• Perfectly positioned for absolute convenience, you will be living just moments away from everything you need. Walk or take a short drive to Alkimos Primary School, Alkimos College, Trinity Village Shopping Centre, local parks, public transport, and the breathtaking Alkimos coastline.<br/><br/>Don't miss the opportunity to make this beautifully maintained, easy-care home your own. Register your interest today to secure a viewing!<br/><br/>Important Information regarding applying for this property:<br/><br/>Online Applications Only<br/><br/>Please feel free to apply online before viewing the property; however, we will only present applications to the landlord from tenants who have viewed in person or through a representative. For those attending on behalf of a prospective tenant, please be advised it is the representative's responsibility to note details seen on the day, including features throughout the property such as air conditioning.<br/><br/>Disclaimer: The above listing information has been provided by sources we deem reliable. We do not accept any responsibility to any person for its accuracy. All interested parties should rely on their own enquiries to determine the accuracy of this information.<br/><br/><br/>",
